"see when inside the hour your electricity actually moved. In the worst "
"case — every one of those hours landing on its least favourable quarter —"
" that shifts the saving shown on this page by %(width)s. Treat it as a "
"bound on how far the pricing could be off, not as a typical error: a real"
" hour will sit somewhere inside its quarters, and this run cannot tell "
"you where."
